; Stage 14 UN-5 negative fixture: bare `cast` is retired.
;
; The legacy unqualified `cast` special form was split in Stage 14 UN-1/UN-4
; into `as` (statically safe) and `unsafe/cast` (unchecked) — design/
; stage14/unsafe-namespace.md D6. Compiling this must FAIL with:
;   "'cast' was split in Stage 14: use 'as' (safe) or 'unsafe/cast' (unchecked)"
(defn main ():i32
  (return (cast i32 0)))
